# Copy to .env for local development. Values here are placeholders.
#
# Everything in this file is browser-visible by design: the publishable key
# and project URL ship in the client bundle, so they are public whether or
# not the repository is. Nothing secret belongs here.
#
# Real secrets — SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, QUIZ_ANSWER_SALT — live in the
# platform environment (Lovable / Cloudflare) and are never committed.

SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-ref
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-publishable-key

VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-ref
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-publishable-key

# Server-only, set in the platform environment, NOT here. Listed so it is
# discoverable. Scored quizzes store a salted hash of the right answer
# instead of the answer, because the repository is public; this is the salt.
# Grading fails loudly if it is unset. See docs/adr/0003-quiz-engine.md.
# QUIZ_ANSWER_SALT=
